# MASTER BUILD PROMPT — CYBER DITHER 3D MUSIC VISUALIZER

## 1. PROJECT VISION

Build a fully functional, visually exceptional, browser-based 3D music visualizer called **CYBER DITHER**.

The experience should feel like a futuristic cybernetic music laboratory, a digital underground club, and an interactive real-time audiovisual simulation combined into one polished web application.

The website must not be a static mockup. It must be a working music player with a curated library of popular songs, functional playback controls, real-time audio-reactive 3D visualizations, animated particles, interactive camera controls, and a sophisticated cyberpunk user interface.

Use the attached screenshot as the primary visual reference for the overall composition and colour palette, but develop the aesthetic into something more atmospheric, intricate, immersive, and refined.

**The most important distinction: this is a music visualizer for popular existing songs, NOT an AI music-generation application.**

Remove the entire AI music generator concept. There must be no procedural track generation, AI-generated music controls, BPM/key/track-length generation forms, or fake generated tracks.

Instead, create an organised, searchable, visually appealing music library containing popular songs. Users should be able to browse the library, select a song, play it when an audio source is available, and watch the 3D environment respond to the music.

Prioritise the following, in this order:

1. A visually stunning, continuously animated 3D environment.
2. A distinctive cyber-dither visual identity.
3. A functional music library and playback system.
4. Accurate, responsive, real-time audio-reactive visualisations.
5. Beautiful transitions, micro-interactions, and cinematic camera movement.
6. A genuinely usable and responsive interface.

Do not sacrifice actual functionality for visual appearance, or visual quality for an unnecessarily complicated interface.

